        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Alongside our existing offering, we plan to lead in new product categories, as we introduce novel solutions and enter additional market segments.",
        "start_character": 38892,
        "end_character": 39037
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001003935-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001003935-26-000010-4a0cdd48e9e37345",
        "accession_number": "0001003935-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Further, we offer holistic transformation consulting services, provided exclusively by our skilled employees, delivering a smooth transition for our customers.",
        "start_character": 42655,
        "end_character": 42814
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001003935-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001003935-26-000010-4a0cdd48e9e37345",
        "accession_number": "0001003935-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, as part of our open platforms, we are enabling the success of our technology partners who complement our product offerings to bring unique value to our customers.",
        "start_character": 45865,
        "end_character": 46040
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001003935-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001003935-26-000010-4a0cdd48e9e37345",
        "accession_number": "0001003935-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, we are seeing some CRM companies, such as Salesforce and Zendesk, that provide a subset functionality of our broader offerings.",
        "start_character": 95372,
        "end_character": 95512
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001003935-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001003935-26-000010-4a0cdd48e9e37345",
        "accession_number": "0001003935-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In most of the areas in which we operate, third parties also have patents which could be found applicable to our technology and products.",
        "start_character": 80171,
        "end_character": 80308
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001003935-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001003935-26-000010-4a0cdd48e9e37345",
        "accession_number": "0001003935-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In our Customer Engagement business, we intend to continue being a leader in the CCaaS market and expand our leadership into AI-first customer experience automation with CXone, a comprehensive CX AI platform, enabling enterprises to design, build and operate customer service automation by seamlessly orchestrating workflows, human and AI agents and knowledge as part of a single, unified and scalable platform.",
        "start_character": 37304,
        "end_character": 37715
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001003935-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001003935-26-000010-4a0cdd48e9e37345",
        "accession_number": "0001003935-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In our Financial Crime and Compliance business, we will continue to expand our offerings across market segments by providing new and enhanced solutions that protect financial services organizations and their customers earlier in the customer lifecycle and by further embedding AI across our portfolio of solutions.",
        "start_character": 40407,
        "end_character": 40721
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001003935-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001003935-26-000010-4a0cdd48e9e37345",
        "accession_number": "0001003935-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In the digital engagement market, we compete against vendors such as LivePerson, which offer digital engagement and self-service capabilities for contact centers.",
        "start_character": 94976,
        "end_character": 95138
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001003935-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001003935-26-000010-4a0cdd48e9e37345",
        "accession_number": "0001003935-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe that the development of new products and solutions and the enhancement of existing products and solutions are essential to our future success.",
        "start_character": 75133,
        "end_character": 75286
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001003935-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001003935-26-000010-4a0cdd48e9e37345",
        "accession_number": "0001003935-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe that the improvement of existing products and the development of new products are important in establishing and maintaining a competitive advantage.",
        "start_character": 79474,
        "end_character": 79633
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001003935-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001003935-26-000010-4a0cdd48e9e37345",
        "accession_number": "0001003935-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We do this by offering comprehensive onboarding programs, consulting services, and white-glove account management.",
        "start_character": 43422,
        "end_character": 43536
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001003935-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001003935-26-000010-4a0cdd48e9e37345",
        "accession_number": "0001003935-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We have several joint offerings across our business segments and combined go-to-market efforts.",
